WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.367
-We have exactly
seven shows left

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.367
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.801
that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:08.767
It is time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:10.067
Here we go.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.567
-♪ "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.200
♪ Seven days left ♪

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.367
-That's right.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:19.868
Every show between
now and Christmas,

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:21.868
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.934
a magnificent Christmas sweater

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:26.334
from the
Countdown to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:27.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:30.300
Since there are
seven shows left,

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.634
let's open door number 7.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.701
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.767
Ooh! Here, right?

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.834
Go for it.
Whenever you're ready.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.968
-Ready.
-Yeah, go.

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:42.767
Oh, wow!

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:45.334
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:49.300
Nice. Thank you very much.
Look at this.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.267
Disco Santa.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.033
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.567
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.434
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.300
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.400
[ Drumroll ]
Who wants a sweater?

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.400
This is a goody, this one.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:17.734
Here we go!
-Here we go.

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:19.100
-114!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.067
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:24.534
Hey, come on.

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.033
Come on.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:34.167
Hi!

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:38.968
Nice to meet you. How are you?
Stand right there.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:40.534
-Right over here.

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.334
-What is your name
and where are you from?

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.367
-I'm Jaslene and I'm from
Norwalk, Connecticut.

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.234
-Hey! Jaslene, welcome!

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.868
Norwalk, it gets very cold
this time of year.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.167
And you have
a beautiful sweater.

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:53.567
-Thank you.
-You almost can't top that.

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:56.501
But then you have this.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.100
Do you have anything like
this in your wardrobe?

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.434
-No, it's unique.
-Yes, thank you.

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:02.000
That's a nice way of putting it.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.067
Would you like to try it on
for everyone?

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:04.767
-I would.
-Oh, this is exciting.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.367
There you go. Roots?

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:09.400
There you go, bud.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.033
-Oh, we've got to do
the hands first.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:12.934
-Oh, yeah,
your hands go through.

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:14.868
Oh, yeah. Oh, no, no, no.
I can already tell.

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:17.901
This is going to be gorgeous.
-I love it.

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:21.234
-Are you -- Come on.
Look at us. You look great.

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:22.701
Come on. How cute.

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:24.834
Yeah, give it up
for our winner right there.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.100
Congratulations.
-Thank you!

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.400
-Guys, stick around.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.934
We'll be right back with
Steve Martin and Martin Short.

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:31.200
Come on back.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

